<title>CROATIA: Croatia Aug monthly RPI at 0.0 pct, 4.7 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Croatia Aug monthly RPI at 0.0 pct, 4.7 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA RETAIL PRICES	 AUGUST   JAN-AUG  JULY   AUG '95</p>
<p> Monthly change (pct)	    0.0	--     +0.4    -0.1</p>
<p> Year-on-year		     +4.7     +3.6    +4.3    +1.9</p>
<p>NOTES -- Croatia introduced a radical anti-inflation programme in October 1993, when monthly inflation hit 38.7 percent. -- Kolumbina Bencevic, Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
